    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Way Of Animals: This World Will Show You the Way that Animals Surviv</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2193510/extras/24aea4477ca4fadea504bc17ec0c753c.avif?t=1733550140\" data-has-big /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Way Of Animals was created and designed for players who are looking for a place to feel like the leader, the protector, the one who guides the herd, a place where you can be the best in the entire African savannah.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Great Multiplayer System</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2193510/extras/00a8e8d669c5f3fb21890174e19f0f9d.avif?t=1733550140\" data-has-big /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a vast environmental protection reserve called Crater. A place where several different species can coexist in total freedom. Be careful, not all the animals that live here are peaceful, some are just waiting for the most opportune moment to make their attack.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Life Cycle System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2193510/extras/3447a7f7ffbdecd13aade77276944227.avif?t=1733550140\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Live and survive from the smallest of the Crater's inhabitants and progress with our Life Cycle System until you become the strongest and most dominant species.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Danger is Everywhere</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2193510/extras/4b97d15dcd882924a97ef0f00cd37c62.avif?t=1733550140\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be prepared for surprise attacks, danger lurks behind every rock. Your cubs will need all your skills to protect them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Great PVP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2193510/extras/dd1ee9776eeb1ec20d52fe4a7043dc50.avif?t=1733550140\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join forces with friends to take down on bigger prey.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Way Of Animals: This World Will Show You the Way that Animals Surviv</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2193510/extras/24aea4477ca4fadea504bc17ec0c753c.avif?t=1733550140\" data-has-big /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Way Of Animals was created and designed for players who are looking for a place to feel like the leader, the protector, the one who guides the herd, a place where you can be the best in the entire African savannah.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Great Multiplayer System</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2193510/extras/00a8e8d669c5f3fb21890174e19f0f9d.avif?t=1733550140\" data-has-big /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a vast environmental protection reserve called Crater. A place where several different species can coexist in total freedom. Be careful, not all the animals that live here are peaceful, some are just waiting for the most opportune moment to make their attack.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Life Cycle System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2193510/extras/3447a7f7ffbdecd13aade77276944227.avif?t=1733550140\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Live and survive from the smallest of the Crater's inhabitants and progress with our Life Cycle System until you become the strongest and most dominant species.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Danger is Everywhere</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2193510/extras/4b97d15dcd882924a97ef0f00cd37c62.avif?t=1733550140\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be prepared for surprise attacks, danger lurks behind every rock. Your cubs will need all your skills to protect them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Great PVP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2193510/extras/dd1ee9776eeb1ec20d52fe4a7043dc50.avif?t=1733550140\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join forces with friends to take down on bigger prey.</p>",
